---
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
---

<SiteLayout
  title="Sumi Privacy Policy — Your Calculations Stay Yours"
  description="Sumi collects no personal data. Your calculation history and settings stay on your device. Read about local storage, optional tips and the website."
>
  <section class="page-heading wrap">
    <p class="eyebrow">YOUR CALCULATIONS STAY YOURS</p>
    <h1>
      Private.
      <br />
      <span>By design.</span>
    </h1>
    <p class="page-intro">
      Sumi collects no personal data.
      <br />
      Your history and settings stay on your device.
    </p>
  </section>
  <article class="prose legal-prose wrap">
    <h2>Privacy policy</h2>
    <p class="policy-date">
      App policy effective 27 August 2026. Website information added 10
      September 2026.
    </p>
    <p>
      Sumi is a scientific calculator for Android and iPhone made by Tomu Ozawa.
      This policy explains what the app does and does not do with your data. The
      short version: Sumi collects no personal data and makes no network
      requests of its own.
    </p>
    <h2>Data stored on your device</h2>
    <p>
      Sumi keeps your calculation history, memory values and settings in the
      app’s private storage on your device so they are there the next time you
      open it. This information is never sent anywhere. You can clear it at any
      time with <em>Reset all</em> in Settings, and it is removed when you
      delete the app.
    </p>
    <h2>Tip jar purchases</h2>
    <p>
      Sumi is free. If you choose to leave a tip, the purchase is processed
      entirely by Apple (through the App Store) or Google (through Google Play).
      Sumi receives only a confirmation that the purchase succeeded; it never
      sees your name, email address or payment details. Apple’s and Google’s
      handling of purchase data is described in the{' '}
      <a href="https://www.apple.com/legal/privacy/">Apple Privacy Policy</a>{' '}
      and the{' '}
      <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy">Google Privacy Policy</a>.
    </p>
    <h2>Third-party services in the app</h2>
    <p>
      Sumi contains no analytics, advertising or crash-reporting software, and
      no third-party code other than the platform billing libraries needed for
      the tip jar.
    </p>
    <h2>This website</h2>
    <p>
      This website uses no visitor analytics, tracking cookies or advertising
      scripts. Fonts and images are served with the site. The example controls
      work in your browser and do not send your selections anywhere.
    </p>
    <p>
      Google Play links contain campaign labels identifying this website and the
      referring page. These labels contain no personal identifier. Google
      processes visits and downloads under its own policies. We use Google
      Search Console and store reports to understand search discovery and
      download interest.
    </p>
    <p>
      The website is hosted on GitHub Pages. Hosting services process
      information needed to deliver pages, such as IP addresses. See the{' '}
      <a href="https://docs.github.com/en/site-policy/privacy-policies/github-general-privacy-statement">
        GitHub Privacy Statement
      </a>
      .
    </p>
    <h2>Children</h2>
    <p>
      Sumi is suitable for a general audience. Because the app collects no data
      from anyone, it collects no data from children.
    </p>
    <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
    <p>
      If Sumi’s behaviour changes in a way that affects your privacy, this page
      will be updated and the effective date above revised.
    </p>
    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>
      Questions about this policy can be sent to{' '}
      <a href="mailto:hello@sumicalculator.com">hello@sumicalculator.com</a>.
    </p>
  </article>
</SiteLayout>
